      "text": "The Vehicular Control Board letter of February 21, 1968 announced a change in the City of New York passenger car replacement cycle, revised vehicle specifications and related subjects. This communication supplements and further details procedure implementing the policy change as stated in Page 3, Section B, of that letter.",
