      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Following is the procedure established for the distribution of new vehicles (passenger cars and station wagons) and the receipt of relinquished vehicles at the Central Vehicle Staging Area, 280 Avenue \"C\" and at the Salvage Section Piers 31 and 33, East River:",
